    "Inspect WS-RIYER-01 scheduled-task and process-creation history around 13:59 UTC, including the parent process, task configuration, and initiating user or service.",
    "Obtain domain-controller authentication records around 13:59 UTC to determine whether the svc-reporting credential use succeeded.",
